--- The prophecy fulfilled
p: The entire Old Testament — Law, Psalms, and Prophets — foretold that Gentiles would glorify God together with Israel under the Messiah.
p: Jesus Christ, the Root of Jesse, now reigns over both Jew and Gentile. Both groups are called to worship the same God with one mind and one mouth ([[Romans 15:6|v. 6]]).
callout: This is not a new plan — it is the fulfillment of God’s ancient promises.

